<title>USA: Good Guys Inc Q4 net loss with charge.</title>
<headline>Good Guys Inc Q4 net loss with charge.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended September 30:    1996			  1995</p>
<p> Sales		    $   212,031,000	   $   213,488,000</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss) (a)    (9,802,000)		   1,043,000</p>
<p> Average Shares		13,597,000		  13,573,000</p>
<p> Earnings (Loss) Per Share	(.72)			   .08</p>
<p>Year Ended September 30:</p>
<p> Sales			  925,714,000		 889,206,000</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss) (a)    (6,219,000)		  14,166,000</p>
<p> Average Shares		13,576,000		  13,427,000</p>
<p> Earnings (Loss) Per Share	(.46)			  1.06</p>
<p>(a) Includes a $3,741,000 charge ($2,329,000 after tax, or $0.17 per share) in 1996 to cover the anticipated early retirement of assets expected to result from remodeling, expanding and/or relocating certain stores for new Expo format.</p>
</text>
